{"name":"Dalelost","status":"ok","title":"Dalelost","pageId":143448,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Maps_of_Dalelost\" title=\"Category:Maps of Dalelost\">Gallery</a></nav>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Dalelost</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p152-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ruins, <small><b>Formerly:</b></small> city</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Land_of_the_Lions\" title=\"Land of the Lions\">Land of the Lions</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/South_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"South Faerûn\">south Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Society<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p152-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"religion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Religions</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bane\" title=\"Bane\">Bane</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Commerce<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_1-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p152-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"exports\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Exports</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pearl\" title=\"Pearl\">Pearl</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Dalelost</b> was a ruined city lying in the <a href=\"/wiki/Land_of_the_Lions\" title=\"Land of the Lions\">Land of the Lions</a> near the <a href=\"/wiki/Lake_of_Steam\" title=\"Lake of Steam\">Lake of Steam</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_1-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p152-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Geography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Geography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Trade\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trade</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Rumors_&amp;_Legends\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Rumors &amp; Legends</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Geography\">Geography</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Geography\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Dalelost?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Geography\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It lay on the northern shore of the Lake of Steam, just south of the <a href=\"/wiki/Ankhwood\" title=\"Ankhwood\">Ankhwood</a> and on the trail between <a href=\"/wiki/Ankhapur\" title=\"Ankhapur\">Ankhapur</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Yhep\" title=\"Yhep\">Yhep</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trade\">Trade</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Trade\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Dalelost?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Trade\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Once upon a time, this settlement was a competitor of Yhep for much of the local <a href=\"/wiki/Pearl\" title=\"Pearl\">pearl</a> trade.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_1-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p152-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Dalelost?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Despite its prosperity, over the course of a decade several disasters and misfortunes—the nature of which was forgotten to history—left Dalelost in ruins and abandoned by its people.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_1-5\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p152-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p><i>Circa</i> <a href=\"/wiki/1372_DR\" title=\"1372 DR\">1372 DR</a>, the ruins of Dalelost were occupied by a cabal of <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Banite\" title=\"Banite\">Banite</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Cleric\" title=\"Cleric\">clerics</a>, though they were in turn dominated by the <a href=\"/wiki/Twisted_Rune\" title=\"Twisted Rune\">Twisted Rune</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_1-6\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p152-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Dalelost?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The Banites maintained a small temple to <a href=\"/wiki/Bane\" title=\"Bane\">Bane</a> and controlled a number of lesser <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">undead</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_1-7\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p152-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Rumors_.26_Legends\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rumors_&amp;_Legends\">Rumors &amp; Legends</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Rumors &amp; Legends\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Dalelost?veaction=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Rumors &amp; Legends\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It was thought that greater undead existed in their lairs below the ruins.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_1-8\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3e-p152-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Dalelost?veaction=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: References\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Dalelost?veaction=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: References\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"reflist\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-FRCS3e-p152-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_1-0\">1.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_1-1\">1.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_1-2\">1.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_1-3\">1.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_1-4\">1.4</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_1-5\">1.5</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_1-6\">1.6</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_1-7\">1.7</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-FRCS3e-p152_1-8\">1.8</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Sean_K._Reynolds\" title=\"Sean K. Reynolds\">Sean K. Reynolds</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Skip_Williams\" title=\"Skip Williams\">Skip Williams</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rob_Heinsoo\" title=\"Rob Heinsoo\">Rob Heinsoo</a> (June 2001). <i><a href=\"/wiki/Forgotten_Realms_Campaign_Setting_3rd_edition\" title=\"Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting 3rd edition\">Forgotten Realms Campaign Setting 3rd edition</a></i>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 152. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/0-7869-1836-5\" title=\"Special:BookSources/0-7869-1836-5\">0-7869-1836-5</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Map included in <a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Green